# Golden files are compared byte for byte against what the code produces, so
# a checkout must never rewrite their line endings. Without this the Windows
# job read every golden file back with CRLF and the comparison failed.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.golden.json -text
testdata/** -text

# The embedded extractors are ELF binaries kept in the tree (skip-worktree,
# rebuilt by `make selfextract`). Never let a line-ending rule near them.
internal/embedded/backimage-selfextract-* binary
